lang: "en"
title: "Dog-friendly beaches in winter: the list by department"
description: "Off-season, many beaches reopen to dogs. The list of beaches where your dog is allowed all year or only off-season, with each beach's rule."
layout: base.njk
---
{#- Beaches and coast where the dog rule (regleChien) is "toute-annee" or "saisonnier". -#}
{%- set plagesAll = (collections.fiches | whereData("breadcrumbCatId", "plages")).concat(collections.fiches | whereData("breadcrumbCatId", "cote-azur")) %}
{%- set hiverPlages = [] %}
{%- for f in plagesAll %}{% if f.data.regleChien == "saisonnier" or f.data.regleChien == "toute-annee" %}{% set hiverPlages = (hiverPlages.push(f), hiverPlages) %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
{%- set nSais = (hiverPlages | whereData("regleChien", "saisonnier")).length %}
{%- set nToute = (hiverPlages | whereData("regleChien", "toute-annee")).length %}
<section class="wrap guide-page">
  <div class="cat-page-crumb"><a href="/en/">Coco Explore</a> / Beaches in winter</div>
  <span class="tag">Season</span>
  <h1>Dog-friendly beaches in winter</h1>
  <p class="guide-lead">Winter is the season of long walks on the sand: many beaches closed to dogs in summer reopen to them off-season. Here are the {{ hiverPlages.length }} Coco Explore beaches where your dog is allowed all year ({{ nToute }}) or only off-season ({{ nSais }}), sorted by department.</p>
  <div class="callout">Dates change from one town to another (end of September, 1 October, 1 November...) and a leash is often still required. Open each beach's listing before you go: the exact rule and its source are written there. Beaches whose rule is unclear or contradictory are not listed here. Please note: the listings are in French (your browser can translate them), and the department names and regions are in French too.</div>
  <p>For the rule on every beach, bans included, see the <a href="/plage-chien">beaches and dogs</a> page (in French). And if you are heading to the mountains: <a href="/en/winter-holidays-with-your-dog">winter holidays with your dog</a>.</p>
</section>

{%- for dep in departements | sort(false, false, "region") %}
{%- set depPlages = hiverPlages | whereDept(dep.id) %}
{%- if depPlages.length %}
<section class="fiches wrap">
  <h2>{{ dep.nom }} <span class="hiver-dep">({{ dep.region }}, {{ depPlages.length }} beach{{ "es" if depPlages.length > 1 }})</span></h2>
  <div class="fiche-grid" data-filterable>
    {%- for fiche in depPlages %}
    {% include "fiche-card.njk" %}
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}
<script src="/card-filter.js" defer></script>
